    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get that. but like, in the long run, isn't it pretty much inevitable that if we don't force this, we just end up with a permanent monopoly where nothing new can ever break through? it feels like the \"stifling innovation\" argument is just a way to protect their moat. what do you think?",
